Another way to think about it: if you have 8 puppies adopted each day, then after 5 days, you would have adopted 5 times 8, which is 40. Which is exactly the total number of puppies. Therefore, that's exactly when they are all adopted. So, that's 5 days. Yeah, that makes sense. I don't see any errors in this reasoning.

